## POST /api/chat

请求 (zod验证):
```typescript
messages: Array<{
  role: "user" | "assistant" | "system",
  content: string  // 1-4000
}>  // 1-50
model?: string  // default "qwen3:32b"
```

响应: text/event-stream (SSE)
- 200: 流式响应
- 400: 验证失败
- 429: Rate limited (20/min/IP)

